# desc: 특허가 겨냥하는 장비 클래스·기술 노드·주제는 무엇인가? — 특허를 장비/세대 축에 붙이는 질의 (소부장 장비사의 IP-R&D)
# suite: core
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX ont:  <https://w3id.org/sdkb/ont/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
SELECT ?title ?targetLabel
WHERE {
  ?patent a ont:Patent ; skos:prefLabel ?title .
  { ?patent ont:realizesEquipmentClass ?target }
  UNION
  { ?patent ont:concernsTechnologyNode ?target }
  UNION
  { ?patent ont:relatedToTopic ?target }
  ?target skos:prefLabel ?targetLabel .
  { ?target a ont:EquipmentClass } UNION { ?target a ont:TechnologyNode } UNION { ?target a ont:RootCause }
}
ORDER BY ?title ?targetLabel
